   'Lower the deadlift to 225 lb / 155 lb or a weight you can lift for 2 good reps when tired. Replace chest-to-bar pull-ups with pull-ups (chin over the bar), banded pull-ups or ring rows. Replace handstand push-ups with pike push-ups on a box or dumbbell strict presses.',
